{"version":4,"id":"d_oAusJaF1x0yN","name":"SR latch (NOR)","nodes":{"n_r":{"id":"n_r","type":"io.switch","position":{"x":130,"y":250},"label":"Reset","params":{"width":1,"value":0}},"n_s":{"id":"n_s","type":"io.switch","position":{"x":130,"y":450},"label":"Set","params":{"width":1,"value":1}},"n_nor_q":{"id":"n_nor_q","type":"gate.nor","position":{"x":310,"y":260},"params":{"inputs":2,"width":1}},"n_nor_qn":{"id":"n_nor_qn","type":"gate.nor","position":{"x":310,"y":440},"params":{"inputs":2,"width":1}},"n_led_q":{"id":"n_led_q","type":"io.led","position":{"x":540,"y":260},"label":"Q","params":{"color":"green"}},"n_led_qn":{"id":"n_led_qn","type":"io.led","position":{"x":540,"y":440},"label":"Q'","params":{"color":"blue"}},"n_grp_inputs":{"id":"n_grp_inputs","type":"deco.group","position":{"x":110,"y":200},"params":{"title":"Inputs","subtitle":"","color":"blue","style":"filled","fontSize":11,"carry":true,"width":8,"height":33}},"n_grp_pair":{"id":"n_grp_pair","type":"deco.group","position":{"x":260,"y":200},"params":{"title":"Cross-coupled pair","subtitle":"Each NOR drives the other's input","color":"purple","style":"filled","fontSize":11,"carry":true,"width":17,"height":33}},"n_grp_out":{"id":"n_grp_out","type":"deco.group","position":{"x":520,"y":210},"params":{"title":"Outputs","subtitle":"","color":"green","style":"filled","fontSize":11,"carry":true,"width":8,"height":32}},"n_note_try":{"id":"n_note_try","type":"deco.text","position":{"x":700,"y":200},"params":{"text":"## Try it\n1. Turn **Set** on — **Q** lights.\n2. Turn **Set** off again — **Q** stays lit.\n3. **Reset** drives it the other way, and sticks.\n\nStep 2 is the whole point. With both inputs back\nat 0 the pair holds whatever it was last given,\nand that held bit is the memory.","format":"markdown","fontSize":12,"align":"left","color":"default","background":"none","width":36,"height":15}},"n_note_how":{"id":"n_note_how","type":"deco.text","position":{"x":700,"y":360},"params":{"text":"### How it holds\nNeither gate decides anything on its own: each\none's output is the other's input. That leaves\ntwo arrangements the pair is happy in, and it\nwill sit in whichever it was last pushed into,\nindefinitely and with no clock involved.","format":"markdown","fontSize":12,"align":"left","color":"default","background":"none","width":36,"height":12}},"n_note_forbidden":{"id":"n_note_forbidden","type":"deco.text","position":{"x":700,"y":480},"params":{"text":"### The state to avoid\nTurn **both** inputs on and Q and Q' go low\ntogether — they stop being opposites, so the\nlatch is no longer storing anything. Let go of\nboth at once and what it settles on comes down\nto which gate lets go first.","format":"markdown","fontSize":12,"align":"left","color":"default","background":"none","width":36,"height":12}},"n_grp_all":{"id":"n_grp_all","type":"deco.group","position":{"x":70,"y":130},"params":{"title":"SR latch","subtitle":"Cross-coupled NOR gates that remember a bit","color":"teal","style":"filled","fontSize":16,"carry":true,"width":101,"height":48}}},"wires":{"w_01":{"id":"w_01","from":{"nodeId":"n_r","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_nor_q","pinId":"in0"}},"w_05":{"id":"w_05","from":{"nodeId":"n_nor_q","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_led_q","pinId":"in"},"waypoints":[{"x":400,"y":280}]},"w_06":{"id":"w_06","from":{"nodeId":"n_nor_qn","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_led_qn","pinId":"in"},"waypoints":[{"x":400,"y":460}]},"w_aigt97jqTRkc":{"id":"w_aigt97jqTRkc","from":{"nodeId":"n_s","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_nor_qn","pinId":"in1"}},"w_YCXRHB0KpjAt":{"id":"w_YCXRHB0KpjAt","from":{"wireId":"w_06","waypoint":0},"to":{"nodeId":"n_nor_q","pinId":"in1"},"waypoints":[{"x":400,"y":420},{"x":280,"y":320},{"x":280,"y":290}]},"w_zirWyWMjutvx":{"id":"w_zirWyWMjutvx","from":{"wireId":"w_05","waypoint":0},"to":{"nodeId":"n_nor_qn","pinId":"in0"},"waypoints":[{"x":400,"y":320},{"x":280,"y":420},{"x":280,"y":450}]}}}